WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.500
It's been a few weeks
since the Homunculi settled in Avancier.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.660
The much-anticipated public bathhouse
is slowly taking shape.

00:09.740 --> 00:13.880
Although many residents were
cautious of the Homunculi in town,

00:14.720 --> 00:17.360
their diligence

00:22.240 --> 00:23.400
and efforts

00:25.400 --> 00:27.580
have garnered increasing support.

00:28.700 --> 00:30.540
Meanwhile,

00:31.290 --> 00:34.880
I've been undergoing mana training
in the Avancier Labyrinth.

00:43.320 --> 00:48.960
Demon Lord Greed could come
and claim the life of the strongest, me.

00:49.500 --> 00:50.680
At any moment,

00:51.600 --> 00:54.080
and I must be prepared for it.

00:57.400 --> 00:59.700
My senses must be sharpened.

01:05.390 --> 01:07.460
What an adorable baby!

01:07.770 --> 01:09.200
(Baybern)

01:09.600 --> 01:11.660
A baby wyvern?

01:11.900 --> 01:15.560
It would cost 70,000 points
to get this monster in a normal lottery.

01:15.560 --> 01:17.420
You hit the jackpot, Nin!

01:17.760 --> 01:20.180
I got a little fairy.

01:20.900 --> 01:22.180
(Lufia)

01:22.340 --> 01:24.200
Oh, it's a devil fairy.

01:24.940 --> 01:27.040
It should come in handy.

01:28.540 --> 01:32.100
Rud, thanks for letting us
use the points.

01:32.100 --> 01:35.240
Thanks to you, I have
a new cute little companion.

01:36.000 --> 01:39.700
Speaking of which, being the labyrinth
manager is really something.

01:39.700 --> 01:42.160
You've gotten so close
to the monsters.

01:43.540 --> 01:47.380
They weren't affectionate with me at all
when I was overseeing the labyrinth.

01:47.380 --> 01:49.580
Well, their love is
a little suffocating.

02:00.070 --> 02:09.900
(The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids,
A Tank with a Rare 9999 Resistance Skill
Got Kicked from the Hero’s Party)

03:20.150 --> 03:22.920
(Opening Day of the Public Bathhouse)

03:23.190 --> 03:26.140
Today, the public bathhouse
opens its doors.

03:26.440 --> 03:28.600
The Homunculi built this, right?

03:28.600 --> 03:30.520
Is it really okay to go inside?

03:31.490 --> 03:35.760
Though the reactions
of the residents remain split…

03:36.620 --> 03:39.000
Is that the rumoured
public bathhouse?

03:39.000 --> 03:41.300
Homunculi are amazing!

03:41.300 --> 03:43.820
We'll be the first customers
to try it out.

03:44.310 --> 03:46.220
Please look forward to it.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.840
I'm heading in.

03:49.300 --> 03:50.100
Is it safe?

03:50.480 --> 03:54.190
It's been a long time
since I've been in such a beautiful bath.

03:54.190 --> 03:56.600
Demon Lords bathe too?

03:56.600 --> 03:59.940
Of course.
What do you take us for?

03:59.940 --> 04:03.060
We are no different
than humans in this regard.

04:03.060 --> 04:04.340
I see.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.790
By the way, where's Luna?

04:06.990 --> 04:10.680
She says she's not used
to showing her body around others.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.600
Is that so?

04:12.020 --> 04:14.890
But perhaps one day
she'll come around.

04:14.890 --> 04:17.100
Let's invite her to join us
when she's ready.

04:17.100 --> 04:18.720
Yes, that's the plan.

04:19.190 --> 04:20.720
All right!

04:20.720 --> 04:23.320
Let's get in and enjoy the bath!

04:23.320 --> 04:24.400
Indeed!

04:24.400 --> 04:26.440
It's quite spacious inside.

04:26.860 --> 04:30.400
It's so luxurious that
it makes me feel a little nervous.

04:30.640 --> 04:34.060
Lilia, let's wash each other.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.890
Bubble cat ears!

04:36.890 --> 04:39.700
Don't play with bubbles as you wash!

04:40.120 --> 04:42.600
Those two are the same as ever.

04:42.600 --> 04:45.460
All right. Let's do it too, Manicia!

04:46.100 --> 04:50.540
I've always wanted
to bathe with a friend too.

04:50.540 --> 04:52.320
I see…

04:55.000 --> 04:57.090
Well, if you don't mind…

04:57.090 --> 04:58.000
All right!

04:58.000 --> 04:59.100
Wait…

04:59.100 --> 05:01.400
I want to join too!

05:01.410 --> 05:03.500
Oh, whatever should I do?

05:06.540 --> 05:08.700
The water's quite warm.

05:08.700 --> 05:10.300
Don't swim in the bath!

05:11.160 --> 05:12.820
Incidentally, Nin,

05:13.200 --> 05:17.360
you were taught
transformation magic in my class.

05:17.360 --> 05:20.280
It's a shame there isn't a mixed bath.

05:20.280 --> 05:21.390
Amon!

05:21.390 --> 05:23.300
We agreed to keep that a secret!

05:24.600 --> 05:27.960
What kind of transformation magic
do you plan to use in the bath?

05:27.960 --> 05:29.660
Magic to increase
the size of one's bosom…

05:29.660 --> 05:30.480
Amon.

05:31.360 --> 05:35.480
Finish that sentence and I'll add the vegetables
you hate to your meals every day.

05:35.680 --> 05:37.690
What? That would be awful!

05:37.690 --> 05:40.190
Is it because among
the women close to Rud,

05:40.190 --> 05:43.060
I am the most full-bosomed,
so you're jealous of me?

05:43.060 --> 05:43.940
What?!

05:44.640 --> 05:46.360
We heard that.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.300
Allow us to verify.

05:48.840 --> 05:50.560
W… Wait!

05:52.000 --> 05:53.800
Stop this at once!

05:57.390 --> 05:58.610
So soft!

05:58.610 --> 06:00.700
Unhand me!

06:00.700 --> 06:03.700
This is to punish you
for saying unnecessary things.

06:03.700 --> 06:05.790
This is something Lilia doesn't have.

06:05.790 --> 06:08.040
Lily! Don't make
unnecessary comments!

06:08.040 --> 06:11.800
I was wrong! Please forgive me!

06:12.840 --> 06:14.720
Something the matter, Manicia?

06:15.290 --> 06:16.400
Not at all.

06:16.400 --> 06:22.080
I'm just happy that I can
finally play with others like this.

06:23.390 --> 06:26.560
Your condition's
a lot better now, right?

06:26.560 --> 06:27.320
Yes.

06:27.660 --> 06:31.560
Then, you'll have plenty of opportunities
to try all sorts of things in the future.

06:31.960 --> 06:33.440
I hope so.

06:33.940 --> 06:35.210
Please!

06:35.890 --> 06:37.990
It's my one and only request!

06:37.990 --> 06:40.600
It's rather noisy in the men's bath.

06:40.890 --> 06:42.240
We're begging you, Rud!

06:42.380 --> 06:44.100
A little peek wouldn't hurt, right?

06:44.100 --> 06:46.490
I'll just make a small hole in the wall.

06:46.490 --> 06:47.990
Absolutely not!

06:47.990 --> 06:49.500
Manicia's there too!

06:49.500 --> 06:52.700
And why are you trying
to peek as well, Marius?

06:52.700 --> 06:54.800
I don't care about the view.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.200
I just enjoy the thrill of it!

06:57.200 --> 06:58.840
Don't be so blatant!

06:58.900 --> 06:59.890
Please!

06:59.890 --> 07:01.590
I want to see Miss Lily's breasts!

07:01.590 --> 07:02.600
I want to see Manicia's—

07:03.200 --> 07:05.800
Are they trying to peek
into the women's bath?

07:05.800 --> 07:06.550
I'll kill them!

07:06.550 --> 07:07.490
Hold on…

07:07.490 --> 07:09.310
Amon, help me hold her back!

07:09.500 --> 07:10.510
Rud!

07:10.510 --> 07:13.500
We're all men here, there's
no point in wasting time arguing!

07:13.500 --> 07:14.500
Exactly!

07:14.500 --> 07:16.460
Just to add, I want to see Lady Nin's!

07:16.460 --> 07:18.780
I know she's flat,
but I still want to see them!

07:21.340 --> 07:24.390
Who said that?

07:24.390 --> 07:26.080
Miss Nin, please calm down!

07:26.460 --> 07:28.480
Enough!

07:29.320 --> 07:30.420
Listen up.

07:30.780 --> 07:34.200
All the girls you've been talking about
are pretty much the same size!

07:34.200 --> 07:36.100
Put up with your own fantasies!

07:44.190 --> 07:46.000
Rud, how did you find the bath?

07:46.000 --> 07:47.600
It was amazing.

07:47.600 --> 07:50.060
Though I had to hold back
those adventurers.

07:51.060 --> 07:52.260
Rud.

07:53.490 --> 07:55.480
There's nothing dangerous
inside, right?

07:55.790 --> 07:57.600
Not at all. It was…

07:57.600 --> 08:00.180
- That felt great.
- Yes.

08:00.180 --> 08:02.500
The neighbouring country's
bathwater is excellent.

08:02.500 --> 08:04.160
I could get addicted to it.

08:04.290 --> 08:07.060
And the handmade soap is fantastic.

08:08.490 --> 08:09.300
You heard them.

08:09.300 --> 08:12.180
Those adventurers looked like
they enjoyed themselves too.

08:12.990 --> 08:14.500
Um…

08:17.420 --> 08:19.600
We await your patronage,

08:19.760 --> 08:22.300
so please come and try it someday.

08:26.590 --> 08:28.400
Got it.

08:29.120 --> 08:32.409
Those men seemed
to have good reviews for the bath.

08:32.409 --> 08:34.240
Let's give it a try too.

08:34.240 --> 08:38.480
Is the fragrance on adventurers
from the handmade soap they mentioned?

08:38.679 --> 08:41.299
Mother, let's try it too.

08:41.299 --> 08:44.420
The bath is free of charge today,
please be sure to come and try it.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.860
Let's try it too.

08:48.920 --> 08:51.080
Manicia, did you enjoy the bath?

08:51.360 --> 08:54.080
Yes, the bath was enjoyable…

08:55.260 --> 09:01.060
But somehow, it feels like
all of us were insulted.

09:01.840 --> 09:04.680
Ah, that was a great bath.

09:05.300 --> 09:08.000
Oh, if it isn't the girls
used in our fantasies?

09:08.790 --> 09:09.640
Lily.

09:09.640 --> 09:11.100
On it, Lilia.

09:11.720 --> 09:13.640
Fusion.

09:20.140 --> 09:21.290
(A Few Days Later)

09:21.290 --> 09:25.300
Thank you, everyone,
for helping build the public bathhouse.

09:25.300 --> 09:26.400
I enjoyed a nice bath.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.720
Thank you very much.

09:28.390 --> 09:30.310
With this public bathhouse,

09:30.310 --> 09:33.500
the folks in town and the Homunculi
have gotten a lot closer.

09:34.000 --> 09:36.040
Please come again.

09:36.480 --> 09:37.470
Samimina.

09:38.790 --> 09:41.760
Thank you for reaching out to humans.

09:46.100 --> 09:47.460
This is for my own sake.

09:47.760 --> 09:50.080
And you have been kind to us.

09:50.080 --> 09:51.380
Even so, thank you.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.420
Rud!

09:53.420 --> 09:54.200
What's wrong?

09:54.200 --> 09:56.020
Another fight
between the adventurers?

09:56.590 --> 10:01.060
A massive horde of monsters is
heading towards Avancier!

10:03.800 --> 10:06.660
I heard there's a large group
of monsters coming towards the town.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.160
The guild seems to have issued
an urgent request to adventurers.

10:10.160 --> 10:12.780
After all, the vigilante corps alone
can't stop them.

10:16.920 --> 10:19.440
With so many people gathered,
we should be able to overcome this.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.140
Everyone.

10:21.600 --> 10:24.600
We're up against over 150 monsters,

10:24.600 --> 10:25.900
but there's no need to fret,

10:26.720 --> 10:29.280
as we are equally matched.

10:29.600 --> 10:31.860
Is that right?

10:32.090 --> 10:35.980
You are aware
we conquered that labyrinth.

10:36.240 --> 10:36.820
Yes.

10:37.400 --> 10:42.300
We conquered Caird Labyrinth,
the one the two major clans failed.

10:42.960 --> 10:46.140
Adventurers fortunate enough
to participate in this battle

10:46.140 --> 10:50.700
will receive generous rewards
for defeating the monsters.

10:52.120 --> 10:55.120
Now, will you accept our request?

11:00.720 --> 11:02.300
Nice pitch.

11:02.780 --> 11:05.240
- Reminds me of the ball in Caird.
- We can win this with Rud on our side.

11:05.240 --> 11:07.800
- I did understate the numbers.
- I heard Luna's strong too.

11:07.800 --> 11:09.800
- There must be about 300 of them.
- The twins will be there, too.

11:10.220 --> 11:13.340
If it's over 100,
everyone will lose count.

11:13.340 --> 11:17.120
And you just have
to defeat all of them.

11:18.140 --> 11:19.880
Rud, do you have a moment?

11:20.760 --> 11:22.500
I sense an unpleasant presence.

11:22.500 --> 11:25.800
It seems a new labyrinth
has appeared nearby.

11:25.800 --> 11:27.320
A new labyrinth?

11:27.640 --> 11:30.820
And it's a formidable one at that.

11:31.160 --> 11:35.160
Could those monsters be connected
to the new Labyrinth?

11:35.490 --> 11:36.910
(Consume Points)
Maybe, yes.

11:36.910 --> 11:38.100
It's just my speculation,

11:38.100 --> 11:42.120
but they must have cloned the monsters
in the labyrinth and sent them out.

11:42.460 --> 11:44.240
Can you do that?

11:44.240 --> 11:45.290
Yes.

11:45.290 --> 11:48.040
So there might be even more monsters
than accounted for.

11:48.800 --> 11:49.720
Got it.

11:50.900 --> 11:53.600
You shall have
the support of my magic.

11:53.600 --> 11:56.440
I'll be at the front line
cutting them down too.

11:56.800 --> 11:58.100
You two…

11:58.100 --> 11:59.880
We'll support you too.

12:03.440 --> 12:06.760
Rud saved us that day.

12:07.560 --> 12:10.440
Wield me as your sword.

12:10.440 --> 12:12.860
Let us protect this town together.

12:13.690 --> 12:16.200
Samimina, everyone…

12:17.320 --> 12:19.600
Thank you.

12:23.200 --> 12:25.860
Baybern and Lufia want to help too?

12:26.860 --> 12:29.600
I have just the job for you guys.

12:35.790 --> 12:38.280
This should strengthen our defence
as much as possible.

12:40.700 --> 12:42.860
The monsters are in sight!

12:43.220 --> 12:44.760
Raise your weapons!

12:45.040 --> 12:48.740
Release long-range magic and skills
when the monsters are close!

13:03.300 --> 13:06.360
Hey… that's more than 300 monsters!

13:06.360 --> 13:08.140
This doesn't look good…

13:08.140 --> 13:08.990
Don't back down!

13:09.320 --> 13:10.080
Look!

13:10.080 --> 13:12.500
The group of monsters
at the front are just Goblins.

13:12.500 --> 13:13.940
No need to be afraid.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.400
Attack!

13:22.640 --> 13:24.860
Looks like we took down quite a lot.

13:29.490 --> 13:31.500
What's the deal with those monsters?

13:33.500 --> 13:35.800
Those Goblins can use magic!

13:39.520 --> 13:40.620
This is bad!

13:40.800 --> 13:43.240
Those aren't normal monsters!

13:43.240 --> 13:43.700
Let's run—

13:43.700 --> 13:45.200
Ready?

13:46.690 --> 13:48.290
Ready to engage at any time.

13:48.290 --> 13:51.000
Fusion complete. Leave it to us.

13:51.160 --> 13:52.900
All right. Let's do this!

13:54.300 --> 13:55.340
Taunt!

14:00.020 --> 14:02.900
He managed to use Taunt
on all the monsters!

14:02.900 --> 14:04.780
Using mana to strengthen the body.

14:06.460 --> 14:08.000
He rushed straight to the centre.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.360
Mister Rud is incredible!

14:11.500 --> 14:13.020
Rud, behind you!

14:15.900 --> 14:16.980
I'm fine.

14:23.860 --> 14:25.380
I see everything.

14:26.000 --> 14:27.200
Impressive.

14:27.200 --> 14:31.260
That lad used mana
to oversee the entire field.

14:32.240 --> 14:33.860
Let's continue the attack.

14:42.240 --> 14:44.280
All right. We took care of them all.

14:44.280 --> 14:46.980
It's all thanks to Rud
for distracting the monsters.

14:47.240 --> 14:50.120
That guy is really strong.

14:50.390 --> 14:52.200
Your shield force's
been fully restored.

14:52.200 --> 14:53.260
Thanks.

14:54.600 --> 14:57.300
After they died,
they all disappeared,

14:57.300 --> 15:01.220
which means those monsters
really did come out of a labyrinth.

15:01.790 --> 15:03.520
What in the world is going on?

15:04.290 --> 15:05.340
Here they come again!

15:05.600 --> 15:08.080
Another wave
of different monsters incoming!

15:08.460 --> 15:09.890
We just defeated so many.

15:09.890 --> 15:11.410
And there are more?

15:11.410 --> 15:13.640
There are even ogres this time!

15:13.940 --> 15:14.990
Remain calm.

15:14.990 --> 15:16.300
But… but…

15:16.300 --> 15:17.220
Don't worry.

15:18.480 --> 15:21.080
We will be victorious!

15:22.400 --> 15:24.900
Another wave incoming!

15:26.800 --> 15:28.900
Chameleon Kong and Fieldsaurus!

15:28.900 --> 15:31.280
Those are monsters
from Avancier Labyrinth!

15:31.400 --> 15:33.290
Why are the monsters
in the labyrinth here?

15:33.290 --> 15:35.060
I can't fight anymore…

15:39.780 --> 15:42.560
They're attacking
the other monsters?

15:42.920 --> 15:44.360
What's going on?

15:44.990 --> 15:46.560
Finally!

15:47.340 --> 15:50.500
Duplicate as many of the Avancier
Labyrinth monsters as you can

15:50.510 --> 15:51.880
and bring them here to support us.

15:53.190 --> 15:56.660
It seems like things are going smoothly
on Lufia and Baybern's side.

15:57.200 --> 15:58.640
Everyone, don't worry.

15:58.640 --> 16:02.220
The monsters from the Avancier Labyrinth
are now under my control.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.980
They are our reinforcements.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.060
Reinforcements?

16:05.060 --> 16:05.940
Is that for real?

16:06.040 --> 16:08.300
I'll charge to the enemy
along with the monsters.

16:08.300 --> 16:10.780
Support me as you did earlier.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.320
Taunt!

16:24.660 --> 16:26.190
Mister Rud is surrounded by ogres!

16:26.190 --> 16:27.840
That doesn't look good!

16:31.590 --> 16:34.700
Labyrinth monsters
actually coming to aid humans.

16:35.760 --> 16:38.040
This is unheard of.
I can't believe my eyes!

16:41.920 --> 16:43.720
Mister Rud is amazing!

16:43.900 --> 16:46.180
I didn't know you were so strong!

16:46.480 --> 16:49.860
No, if it weren't for everyone's help,
I wouldn't be able to defeat them.

16:50.100 --> 16:52.020
Thank you all for your hard work!

16:52.800 --> 16:55.120
I brought some spinach.

16:55.120 --> 16:57.120
Come to me if you're injured.

16:57.120 --> 17:00.240
I'll repair everyone's
damaged weapons for free.

17:04.890 --> 17:08.380
Thank you for helping
protect this town.

17:09.359 --> 17:11.200
That was a magnificent battle.

17:11.200 --> 17:11.960
Amon.

17:12.290 --> 17:17.420
To think you would use
the opponent's trick against them.

17:17.839 --> 17:21.560
I just thought if the enemy
can do it, so can we.

17:22.020 --> 17:23.040
But more than that,

17:23.040 --> 17:26.599
the most important thing right now is
to raid the new labyrinth.

17:26.960 --> 17:30.460
This dangerous labyrinth released
such a large number of monsters,

17:30.460 --> 17:32.020
I can't leave it unchecked.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.620
Indeed.

17:34.160 --> 17:38.520
If it is him, he'll definitely release
even more monsters next time.

17:38.890 --> 17:39.860
Him?

17:40.820 --> 17:43.840
The new labyrinth is most likely

17:44.690 --> 17:46.920
the work of Demon Lord Greed.

17:47.890 --> 17:50.360
Demon Lord Greed…

17:51.980 --> 17:54.940
I sense his mana in the area.

17:55.390 --> 17:56.380
Then...

17:56.940 --> 17:59.760
We have to get to Greed's labyrinth
as soon as possible.

18:01.820 --> 18:05.880
We must stop him from creating
such disturbances again.

18:07.560 --> 18:08.520
Rud…

18:09.500 --> 18:13.460
What do you plan to do
after defeating Greed?

18:13.840 --> 18:17.020
Do you intend to extend an invitation
to him as you did with me?

18:17.620 --> 18:20.220
I'm not sure
if I should let him join us.

18:20.540 --> 18:22.700
After all, I can't forgive him.

18:22.700 --> 18:24.860
The Homunculi must hate him, too.

18:25.190 --> 18:27.080
Are you going to kill him?

18:27.590 --> 18:31.260
Greed is the only one who knows
the situation in Brunn Quelez.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.480
If possible,
I'd like to capture him alive.

18:34.090 --> 18:36.680
In that case, use these.

18:37.390 --> 18:41.400
These cuffs can seal
the power of a Demon Lord.

18:41.700 --> 18:44.880
It's similar to the slave bracelet
I mentioned.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.760
It should be useful
when you raid his labyrinth.

18:47.990 --> 18:50.040
Thank you for all your help.

18:50.040 --> 18:51.200
My pleasure.

18:51.200 --> 18:54.140
I do quite enjoy my life here.

18:54.540 --> 18:57.200
All right. Let's get going.

18:57.590 --> 18:58.300
No.

18:58.940 --> 19:03.620
This time, Nin, Luna,
Lilia, Lily, Samimina,

19:04.840 --> 19:06.100
and I will go.

19:07.540 --> 19:09.640
Samimina's combat abilities
is enough for us.

19:10.000 --> 19:13.340
I want to put her powers to use
in the Greed Labyrinth.

19:14.290 --> 19:15.500
Understood.

19:15.990 --> 19:17.680
What's the meaning of this, Rud?

19:17.690 --> 19:19.160
Why am I being left out?

19:19.160 --> 19:19.880
I'm sorry.

19:20.820 --> 19:22.980
I want you to stay in town
and lead the adventurers.

19:23.300 --> 19:25.960
Amon will be in charge
of the magic support team.

19:26.300 --> 19:28.860
No, I want to fight too!

19:30.390 --> 19:32.700
During the battle earlier,
I realised something.

19:32.700 --> 19:35.380
Sending out the monsters
was part of Greed's strategy.

19:35.710 --> 19:38.580
So even after we go in
to conquer the labyrinth,

19:38.590 --> 19:39.800
he might send more monsters.

19:41.920 --> 19:44.440
You are closer to the adventurers,

19:44.440 --> 19:47.040
and as the subleader of the clan,
you are trusted by everyone.

19:48.190 --> 19:52.340
I can only entrust
such a dangerous battlefield to you.

19:56.120 --> 19:58.520
All right. Let's do that then.

19:58.800 --> 20:00.300
Don't worry about things here.

20:00.640 --> 20:03.860
Whatever comes,
I will defeat them all.

20:05.040 --> 20:07.920
Leave the support command to me.

20:08.600 --> 20:10.800
Thank you both.

20:13.490 --> 20:15.280
After the battle just now,

20:15.290 --> 20:17.960
we've confirmed that
a new labyrinth has emerged nearby.

20:18.500 --> 20:21.560
So, we're going to raid
that labyrinth.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.500
If monsters come to attack again,

20:25.500 --> 20:28.840
please protect the town together
with Avancier's monsters.

20:36.590 --> 20:37.510
Um…

20:37.800 --> 20:38.700
Yes?

20:38.890 --> 20:43.460
Is Demon Lord Greed really
in the labyrinth we're going to raid?

20:43.940 --> 20:45.280
I'm afraid so.

20:46.840 --> 20:49.000
You know who Greed is, right?

20:49.660 --> 20:51.100
Of course.

20:51.100 --> 20:54.320
Among the Homunculi, there's no one
who hasn't heard his name.

20:55.300 --> 20:56.500
I see.

20:56.500 --> 20:58.980
Don't force yourself.

21:00.390 --> 21:01.200
Yes.

21:06.990 --> 21:09.260
What's with this labyrinth?

21:09.860 --> 21:11.160
There's nothing here.

21:11.720 --> 21:13.480
I'll search the area with my magic.

21:17.660 --> 21:19.740
There's really nothing here.

21:20.220 --> 21:22.660
Let's move to the next level, then.

21:23.100 --> 21:27.440
There doesn't appear to be a magic circle
that leads to the next floor either.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.540
What?

21:28.540 --> 21:29.540
That means…

21:29.940 --> 21:32.920
this is the lowest floor
of the labyrinth?

21:35.260 --> 21:37.760
Such intense mana!

21:39.420 --> 21:41.980
There's no need for such hostility.

21:47.000 --> 21:50.820
My name is Greed.
